    @classmethod
    def EnableFULIAccess(cls, target, *args, session="default", **kwargs):
        'EnableFULIAccess(  string  aLabel,  ExperimentDevice  device ) Enable the FULI access for given device + Variable name The method is designed for INCA version V6.2 Do not use in former versions.  Parameters  aLabel ( String )  label for a measure or calibration element  device ( ExperimentDevice )  device for the specified label (should answer true when isFULISupported is called)  Return Value  true if the FULI Access could be enabled successful for label, otherwise false.  -  Work only with connected ES910 - Vor dem anmelden müssen die Größen entweder im Experiment vorhanden oder per API angemeldet werden. - Das Kommando " SwitchCalibrationAccessOff" und"SwitchCalibrationAccessOn" müssen verwendet werden. - Werden nur Messgrößen ausgewählt, so muss vor dem Verbinden mit ILink die Messdatenanzeige gestartet werden. Beispiel VBA: \'Verstellgrößen anmelden x = ON_EXP_ID.SwitchCalibrationAccessOff a = 0 i = 1 Do While a = 0 If Cells(i + 1, 1).Value = "" Then Exit Do Else Set y = ON_EXP_ID.GetCalibrationElementInDevice(Cells(i + 1, 1).Value, Device_Fuli_ID) Set y1 = y.GetValue x = ON_EXP_ID.EnableFULIAccess(Cells(i + 1, 1).Value, Device_Fuli_ID) i = i + 1 End If Loop \'Messgrößen anmelden a = 0 i = 1 Do While a = 0 If Cells(i + 1, 2).Value = "" Then Exit Do Else Set Z = ON_EXP_ID.GetMeasureElementInDevice(Cells(i + 1, 2).Value, Device_Fuli_ID) Set z1 = Z.GetValue x = ON_EXP_ID.EnableFULIAccess(Cells(i + 1, 2).Value, Device_Fuli_ID) i = i + 1 End If Loop x = ON_EXP_ID.SwitchCalibrationAccessOn x = Device_Fuli_ID.SwitchToWorkingPage x = ON_EXP_ID.StartMeasurement\nSource topic: Tool-API Verbindung aufbauen   / Experiment  / work with Experiment / iLink / EnableFULIAccess'
        return Inca.invoke(target, 'EnableFULIAccess', *args, session=session, **kwargs)

